        "thread_id": "TH1",
        "thread_goal": "Align on current loading, stacking and cleaning practices and main pain points.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M1",
            "speaker_id": 40035,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, let's kick off the 'Warehouse Loading Bay Safety and Efficiency Upgrade' project. To start, can everyone share how we currently handle loading and cleaning on a typical day? What are the biggest headaches?",
            "mentions": [
              18289,
              27041,
              72769,
              366315
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "wave",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 27041,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Sure. For the city routes, it's mostly last-in, first-out. We stage the pallets near the bay door, but sometimes the morning shift leaves things in the way. Stacking depends on who's on the forklift, there isn't really a standard rule we all follow.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 72769,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "For cleaning, we're supposed to sweep at the end of the shift. But if we're running late with a truck, it sometimes gets missed.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 366315,
            "reply_to": "M3",
            "text": "Exactly. And the oil drips from the old forklift never get properly cleaned, just covered with sawdust. It's a slipping hazard. We need a proper checklist.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_plus_sign",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 18289,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "Good points. The lack of a standard stacking procedure is a major risk, especially with mixed loads. I've seen pallets get top-heavy. This is exactly what we need to capture for T1, mapping the current process and its weak spots.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 40035,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "So for T1, should we focus on the city routes like 27041 mentioned, and maybe the long-haul route to the northern hub? They have the most varied cargo.",
            "mentions": [
              27041
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 18289,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "That's a solid plan. Focusing on the high-volume, high-variety routes first will give us the biggest impact. Let's formalize that.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D1"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M8",
            "speaker_id": 27041,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "Works for me. I can start documenting the steps for the city routes this afternoon.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M9",
            "speaker_id": 366315,
            "reply_to": "M7",
            "text": "I'll start a draft for the feedback log A5 so we can begin capturing these issues formally.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A5"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "clap",
                "count": 1
