            "text": "Team, the pilot week is complete. Thanks for all the hard work. I've summarized the key findings from the 'Pilot Feedback and Incident Log' (A5) and our conversations (T8). Overall, positive results but a few areas for improvement. Please review the summary and let's discuss final changes.",
