            "speaker_id": 40035,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "The new stacking guideline in A2 definitely helped with stability, but it did slow us down by about 10% on the first two days. By Friday, we were back to normal speed. I think it's just a learning curve. We should mention that in the training.",
